  - **Reason**: Definition of Done Item 3 explicitly specifies `PeerTrust::new(profile.clone(), Arc::new(HttpsJwksFetch))` in step 3, while step 6 requires `profile` (`obtain_id_token_desktop(&profile, &nonce)`). `ProviderProfile` did not previously implement `Clone`. All of its constituent fields are `Clone`, so adding the derive allows step 3 to clone `profile` without altering runtime semantics or design contracts.
